 Project Plan and Steps
🛠️ Step 1: Project Setup
Create a Django project and app

Install dependencies: djangorestframework, drf_yasg, django-cors-headers, django-environ

👤 Step 2: Custom User Model
Use AbstractBaseUser to store email, password, first name, last name, DOB, age

🔐 Step 3: Authentication
Token-based or JWT authentication for Signup/Login

📋 Step 4: Task Model
Fields: task_name, description, status (choices: Incomplete, Complete), user (ForeignKey)

🔄 Step 5: CRUD Operations
Create, Retrieve, Update (status/details), Delete, and List Tasks

🔍 Step 6: Filtering Tasks
Filter by status using query parameters

📧 Step 7: Email Notification
Send email when status is updated to "Complete"

📑 Step 8: Swagger Integration
Auto-generate API docs with drf_yasg

